#: src/ui/widgets.md:377
msgid "BottomNavigation"
msgstr "BottomNavigation"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:379
msgid ""
"5-tab bottom bar with icon + label + badge per tab. `onSelect(index)` fires "
"when the user taps; `bottomNavSetSelected` is the programmatic counterpart "
"and does NOT fire `onSelect`."
msgstr ""
"แถบด้านล่างแบบ 5 แท็บ พร้อมไอคอน + ป้ายชื่อ + ตราสัญลักษณ์ในแต่ละแท็บ `onSelect(index)` "
"จะถูกเรียกเมื่อผู้ใช้แตะ ส่วน `bottomNavSetSelected` "
"เป็นเวอร์ชันสำหรับเรียกจากโปรแกรมและจะไม่เรียก `onSelect`"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:383
msgid ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import {\n"
"  BottomNavigation,\n"
"  bottomNavAddItem,\n"
"  bottomNavSetBadge,\n"
"} from \"perry/ui\";\n"
"\n"
"const bar = BottomNavigation((index) => {\n"
"  console.log(\"tab:\", index);\n"
"});\n"
"bottomNavAddItem(bar, \"house\", \"Home\");\n"
"bottomNavAddItem(bar, \"magnifyingglass\", \"Search\");\n"
"bottomNavAddItem(bar, \"bell\", \"Activity\");\n"
"bottomNavSetBadge(bar, 2, \"5\");\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import {\n"
"  BottomNavigation,\n"
"  bottomNavAddItem,\n"
"  bottomNavSetBadge,\n"
"} from \"perry/ui\";\n"
