"Perry supports animating widget properties for smooth transitions. Every "
"snippet below is excerpted from [`docs/examples/ui/animation/snippets.ts`]"
"(../../examples/ui/animation/snippets.ts) — CI compiles and runs it on every "
"PR."
msgstr ""
