"it.\n"
"const rate = Percent(0.15)\n"
"console.log(t(\"Discount: {rate}\", { rate }))\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"// Percent: input is a decimal (0.15 → 15 %). en omits the space; de/fr add "
"it.\n"
