#: src/i18n/formatting.md:121
msgid "Raw"
msgstr "Raw"

#: src/i18n/formatting.md:123
msgid ""
"Pass-through — prevents any automatic formatting. Use when a parameter name "
"might trigger auto-formatting but you want the raw value:"
msgstr ""
