#: src/cli/perry-toml.md:9
msgid ""
"```toml\n"
"[project]\n"
"name = \"my-app\"\n"
"entry = \"src/main.ts\"\n"
"\n"
"[build]\n"
"out_dir = \"dist\"\n"
"```"
